---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: How to reach Meridion Systems.
permalink: /contact/
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="label">Contact</p>
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
    <p class="sub">Questions about a product, or anything else? A person reads every message.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" style="padding-bottom: var(--section)">
  <div class="pair">
    <a class="tile" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
      <p class="tile__k">Email</p>
      <p class="tile__v">{{ site.email }}</p>
      <p class="tile__d">Best for questions and feedback.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="tile" href="{{ site.founder.linkedin }}">
      <p class="tile__k">LinkedIn</p>
      <p class="tile__v">{{ site.founder.name }}</p>
      <p class="tile__d">The founder's profile.</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
